{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_15_level_main_15-15_end_variation02",
  "groupId": "main_15",
  "stageId": "main_15-15",
  "title": "“她”",
  "storyCode": "15-17",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-15_end_variation02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "41cf5e1359563a77f5011efd4f4e72062ea7b7d38a7dc0165a553179b3f67c86",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert03_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们已经走出去很远了，恐怕再继续探索，也没有太大的意义了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "离我进入休眠已经过去了一万个自然日，泰拉的变化依然有限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来自塔卫二的生命的火种还没有壮大。我往日的同伴，他们埋下的那几颗希望的种子，也迟迟没有发芽的迹象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "AMa-10",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（表示沮丧的动作）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失望吗？不......对这个结果，我也早有预期就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我错估了一切发展的进度，这是一个错误的时间，我所能做的事也十分有限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "时间......我需要更多的时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能继续浪费这具身体的寿命了，我必须要回那座石棺继续沉睡，等待更成熟的时机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不得不承认，我违背了诺言，这的确是一种背叛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是因为我依然热爱着生命，我没有办法做出希望以外的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是恐怕，她已经预料到了我提前苏醒的举动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在我休眠的石棺中，发现了修改灰质销钉的程序。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "AMa-10",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（表示疑问的动作）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是诞生在失落时代的技术，用以坚定我们的思维还有信念，若非如此，许多人的意志恐怕不足以支撑过那段没有尽头的绝望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和她共同度过了那段时间......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毫无疑问，她是最了解我的人，也是最理解我的人。也正因如此，与她的分歧，是我最深的遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她预料到了我的举动，隐藏在石棺中的程序随着我的苏醒而启动。它会修改我的认知，还有“辩论”的目的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我必须回到那座唯一的石棺来延续我的生命，尽管那意味着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我的时间不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "AMa-10......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我不应该再这样称呼你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是一个代号，一种机械造物的代号。我应该给你起一个真正的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "方解石......光线在晶体中折射出两种不同的偏振光，那是很美丽的现象，和你很像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Calcite......Kal'tsit......就叫你凯尔希吧。你喜欢这个名字吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "AMa-10",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（表示喜悦的动作）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有一些我来不及做到的事，我希望，能由你代我去完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希，我希望你能去保护这片大地上的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新生的文明总是脆弱，艰难的环境却绝不会因此多半分仁慈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "插手文明的发展是一种傲慢，但我们的机会已经不多了，我也不知道这是否是我们仅有的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "文明循环往复，总是不可避免地重复歧路。他们会陷入暴力的争斗，无法自证的思维陷阱，自我怀疑的绝路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些事情都没有办法避免，但只是一点微小的偏差就足以让一个文明万劫不复。文明存在本身就是一种奇迹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以凯尔希，我希望你可以去指引他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "双生循环的结构可以让你拥有近乎无限的生命，你可以陪伴拙稚的文明发展，你可以运用你的知识，去引导他们走上可以前行的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是一项艰难的使命，但是你或许可以做到，你应该——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一阵沉默。\n富于激情的演说戛然而止，预言家沉默地看了看眼前纤细精巧的机械生命，又看了看远处半隐藏在风沙中的群山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......忘了我刚才说的吧，凯尔希，忘了它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧。凯尔希。先去周围看看，再去远一些的山那头看看。去寻找生命的痕迹，去寻找存在的形式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我得回去了。等到你需要的时候，就唤醒我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希，我希望你去做的事，或者说，我赋予你的使命，只有一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去找到你自己吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去寻找生命的痕迹，去寻找希望与未来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "预言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希......自己去得出答案吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（兴奋的咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mon3tr出现在你的身前，它的姿态却稍不同于往常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不用凯尔希的命令，它以迅猛的速度向敌人飞去，可一簇源石结晶拔地而起，将黑色的怪物完全包裹其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凯尔希！当心——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很让我惊喜，AMa-10。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以切断自己双生循环的系统为代价来脱离我的控制，哪怕这样会使你的生命变得脆弱不堪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，你真的打算用这样的方式杀了我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，在很久之前，你的意识已经与源石中的信息海洋同化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这种情况下，真正杀死你已经是不可能的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是特蕾西娅和特雷西斯做到的事，让我确信了一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你对源石的控制并非无可动摇，依然存在一些手段来限制你对于源石的权限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你所说的两个人，我的确在源石内部见过他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的努力的确出人意料，是令人惊喜的挣扎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以呢？你又如何确信，在这里杀了我不是徒劳之举？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr攻击你的时候，你选择了防御。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你怎么能做到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来你已经察觉到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "基于特蕾西娅对源石的研究，同样是模仿你对Dr.{@nickname}设下的陷阱，我对你所处的唤醒室加入了一些设计。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你在这里醒来，你的意识，同样会困于这具身体，而无法重新回到源石内部的信息海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许你迟早能突破这一层限制，而且你依然有操作源石的权限，但此刻的你，也只是一个人类。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你为了反抗我，竟然会做到这一步——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "普瑞赛斯，你不是泰拉的造物主。这片大地上的一切生命，没有义务顺应你的意愿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这是我对你的报复，也是最后的反抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你看到站在对面的女性脸上露出了一丝犹疑，但紧接着，源石开始在她的身旁环绕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......太迟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米娅！帮助凯尔希！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（激昂的咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希医生......这一次换我来保护您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑色的法术乱流击碎了源石晶簇，Mon3tr挣脱而出，继续向唯一的目标袭去。\n源石晶簇重新开始聚集，却已经来不及构成足以抵挡Mon3tr爪锋的屏障。\n你看到了普瑞赛斯紧张的神情，造物主面对她的造物流露出了恐惧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "似乎是普瑞赛斯终于认同了她此时面临着威胁，整片甲板上的源石都开始回应她的意识而急剧滋长。\nMon3tr已经逼近了它的猎物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g15_rhodesabyss_off"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "右侧五名，确认瘫痪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“殁亡”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看上去神神道道的，结果不还是把那些我们已经打败过一次的敌人再拉出来一遍嘛，没什么大不了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再吃我这招——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我的错觉吗？这里原地产生敌人的速度好像变慢了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里是PRTS的核心系统，从一开始，它就是在读取我们以往面对过的敌人的数据并复制出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是现在它读取资料库数据的速度变慢了，似乎是受到了一些阻碍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来是博士那边的行动奏效了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓紧这个机会，一举攻破它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们要到Abyss深处去......还有人在等着我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr，熔毁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑色的法术和激光轮番射向前方庞杂的源石晶簇，这样猛烈的攻势甚至压制住了源石扩张的态势。\n直到法术的光芒淹没了普瑞赛斯的身形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "烟尘散去后，只剩下一地的源石碎屑。\n还有一件残破的白色外套。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们......打败她了吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我感受不到......任何生命的迹象，感受不到任何情绪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "情况发生得太突然，你对眼前的一系列变故都还没来得及有些实感。\n你亲眼目睹了那个极具威胁的敌人在你面前灰飞烟灭。\n可你没有任何松了一口气的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玩闹可以到此为止吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "怎么回事......！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这怎么会——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士、阿米娅，后退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有力的反抗，AMa-10，你的计划奏效了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诚如你所说，现在你们的确有杀死我的机会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，只是一个用源石塑造出的替身，就会让你如此慌张吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "AMa-10，我无意与你辩论你信奉的价值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一直以来所坚持的事，它们太渺小，我甚至无法找到一种可信的逻辑架构来评价它们的意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是实验中的确会出现这样的情况，一些细小的误差，最终造成了巨大的妨碍。我不得不接受这样的结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很遗憾，要将你当作这个误差来抹除。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "普瑞赛斯抬起了手。\n源石再次开始生长，结晶构成的尖锐的枝桠在你与阿米娅的身边密集地围绕起来，顷刻间便要将你们吞没。\n阿米娅拼尽全力用法术击碎周遭的源石，可晶簇生长的速度远为迅捷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！躲在我身后——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这一切都在电光石火间发生。\n你看到源石晶簇在与你近在咫尺的地方炸裂，阿米娅想要保护你，可时间不允许她作出任何反应。\n你看到黑色怪物在这一瞬间来到了你和阿米娅的身边，用庞大且坚实的身躯挡在了你们与源石晶簇之间。\n你看到了凯尔希......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你会质疑自己存在的意义吗，博士？我会。\n我很清楚自己的使命，尽管艰难，但我认同它的意义。\n关于未来，你会有自己的答案，我只能这样坚持。\n不用太担心我的事情，罗德岛不应当脆弱到离开了某人就无法前行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我的愿望？\n我的愿望就是守护好你和阿米娅的愿望。\n我立下的誓言我永远不会背弃。尽管我们对守护的定义各不相同，但我会站在这里，直到最后。\n我们无法忘怀过去，但你会有不一样的未来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我已经寻找到了自己生命的意义。\n请带领罗德岛......\n继续走下去吧。\n{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希医生——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......凯尔希......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "意外发生得无比突然，但已经足以让你理解这个残酷的事实。\n你们所对抗的，并不是可被常理理解的敌人，她拥有着操控一切源石的权限。\n凯尔希右肩上的那一点源石结晶，是她生而为人的证据，也是夺走她生命的根源。\n源石结晶开始扩散，直至吞噬了她整个身躯，然后碎裂，随风消散——你的眼睛来不及捕捉这一完整过程。\n越是强大，越是脆弱。\n长生之人的生命在此终结。\n她已经完成了她的诺言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
